        <mxCell id="text25" value="- Channel buffers contain samples without headers.&#10;- Acquisition ticks are returned in completion records.&#10;- Every block: 1024 samples (IQ16: 4096 B; IQ12: 3072 B).&#10;- Block i address = address[channel] + i × split_size" style="text;html=0;align=left;fontColor=#24476b;fontSize=18;" parent="1" vertex="1">
